{{Quote|I have been in contact with the other clanholds. We are not the only ones affected--the entire planet screams at what the dark one is building on the Gahenn Plains.|[[Kkkt]]|<ref name="Dark Lord 23" />}}
The '''Gahenn Plains''',<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref> also known as the '''plains of Gahenn''',<ref name="Crimson Reign 4">[[Crimson Reign 4|''Crimson Reign'' 4]]</ref> were a location on the [[planet]] [[Mustafar]]. At some point during the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], the [[Sith Lord]] [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] had his [[Fortress Vader|castle]] built over the ancient [[Sith cave]] located in the Gahenn Plains.<ref name="Dark Lord 23" />

